  "id": "message-ref-i12-to-bundle",
  "url": "https://ferrobridge.eu/fhir/v2mappings/ConceptMap/message-ref-i12-to-bundle",
  "name": "FerroBRIDGERefI12ToBundle",
  "title": "FerroBRIDGE supplement: REF_I12 to Bundle",
  "status": "active",
  "experimental": true,
  "publisher": "Cadasto B.V. (FerroBRIDGE)",
  "description": "Adds a message map for the HL7 v2 REF_I12 structure (I12, patient referral; http://hl7.org/v2/StructureDefinition/REF_I12), for which hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0 ships none. The rows are those of ConceptMap/message-adt-a01-to-bundle for MSH, SFT, PID, NK1, IN1, IN3, DG1, AL1, PR1, PV1 and PV2 at their REF_I12 paths (the visit under PATIENT_VISIT), and those of ConceptMap/message-oru-r01-to-bundle for the OBR, the OBX and the NTE of the OBSERVATION group. The guide ships no segment map for RF1, AUT, PRD, CTD, GT1, ACC or DRG, so the referral itself stays counted as unmapped. FerroBRIDGE #637.",
